schema: claim-evidence
object:
  title: "Otter.ai free-tier transcription limits (300 min/month, 30 min/call)"
  type: claim-evidence
  claim: >-
    Otter.ai's free tier gives 300 transcription minutes a month, capped at
    30 minutes per conversation, with automated summaries and action items;
    the Pro plan is $8.33/month billed annually for 1,200 minutes.
  evidence: >-
    Cited in the article from Otter.ai's own pricing page
    (otter.ai/pricing), referenced in the article's References section.
  interpretation: >-
    Used to size Otter.ai's free tier as "enough for a small team's weekly
    call" in the article's recommended starter stack.
  uncertainty: >-
    The article itself flags this figure as time-sensitive: "verify the
    current limits before you commit; transcription pricing changes often."
    Not independently re-verified against Otter.ai's live pricing page for
    this ingestion.
